This directory contains a modified copy of @thinkrail/pi-ask-user-question 0.2.0
(https://github.com/JetBrains/thinkrail, pi-extensions/ask-user-question),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications by the pi-wrapper plugin:
- tool renamed from ask_user_question to ask_question;
- added src/rpc.ts: the questionnaire is sent to the plugin as one `input`
  request (JSON payload in the title) instead of sequential dialogs;
- added a per-question "chat" answer kind: the user can mark questions as
  needing a more detailed explanation, which the agent explains in chat;
- questionnaire result text reports those marked questions instead of
  terminating the turn.
